Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:06.50,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Suzuki! Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, Azuma. Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.87,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Your plushie's from that movie, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.53,0:00:13.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's right! Fluffy-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:14.37,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Who'd you go with?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.27,0:00:17.04,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Nabe? Sato?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.37,0:00:19.24,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:21.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:25.30,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh? Why Tani?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:29.26,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We're dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:33.05,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,You're what?! You didn't say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.05,0:00:34.34,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I sort of forgot to!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:35.59,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Tell me this stuff, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:37.91,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Wait, how? And when?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:38.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Super recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.19,0:00:40.14,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,How did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:41.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:42.52,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Who made the first move?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:44.27,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.09,0:00:46.18,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Was it blackmail?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:47.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Listen to what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:49.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(204,218)\c&H720D6A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\b1\shad0\fnComic Sans MS\fs28}~ EXPLANATION\N SCENE\NOMITTED ~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.93,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Whoa, seriously? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:55.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I can't tell what kind of reaction that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:57.16,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,The good kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:03.36,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I'm super jealous. Just, you know, that hit \Ndealt some major damage. It's exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:04.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um, thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:07.46,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,And, Suzuki, you're super composed \Nabout it all. That surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:09.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Me? Not Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.91,0:01:13.02,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,If you want to fall in love \Nwith a decent person,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:15.33,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,you yourself need a level of respectability.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:16.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:20.95,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,If only my boyfriend had been like Tani.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:24.79,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,He suddenly stopped texting, \Nand I wondered if he'd ghosted me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:28.22,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,but the truth was that \Nhe got thrown in juvie. Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.22,0:01:30.80,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,But it's not the kind of thing \Nthat normally happens, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.31,0:01:33.74,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Awesome, right? I wish him much happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:36.62,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Nope. That normally doesn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.33,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(141,352.667)\fad(479,1)\b1\shad0\c&H514A3D&\fnArial\fs32\3c&HFFFFFF&}* {\fs18}JUVIE = JUVENILE DETENTION
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:39.62,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Taira, do you watch movies and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:41.18,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I like movies, but audiences...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:43.50,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It's like a gacha pull, so I'm not a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.84,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Gapacho said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:49.14,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I wanna go see the one with \Nthe witch and the fluffy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:50.75,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You don't seem the type.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.43,0:01:51.48,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But still, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:53.14,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Oh, that's Suzuki's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:54.78,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't know, but I think \Nit depends on the person, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.14,0:01:54.34,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,She's so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:58.37,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,No, really. I only ever fall in love with scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.37,0:02:01.60,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Whenever I get that "oh, my!" \Nas a first impression, the guy's always scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:04.33,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It's first thing in the morning. \NWhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:08.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We're talking about how Azu \Ncan find herself a happy romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:12.96,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I just don't get a yummy vibe from honest men.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:14.49,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it's too late for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:17.22,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Girls seem to like thugs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:20.29,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Pretty girls are more likely \Nto date older delinquents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:21.10,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:23.25,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,That's just your memories from middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:28.46,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But, to be honest, when someone has a little \Nbit of bad in their aura, it's kinda cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:31.26,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(189.334,169.334)\fad(521,1)\fs24\fnArial\b1\i1\shad3\bord2\c&HDCA0F8&\3c&HE13B62&\4c&HE13B62&\frz26.37}SUDAKEN
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.26,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,and I totally understand \Nbeing attracted to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:34.27,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Suzuki, you do love your SudaKen, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:38.76,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,So basically, in the end, you're just \Nchoosing people based on a hierarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:43.02,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\pos(440,226)\fs24\shad0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H8DFFFC&\3c&H896589&}GA\N\hHA\N\h\hHA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:43.02,Default,text; top,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs36\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\bord3\c&H91FFFC&\3c&H762EEB&}The HIERARCHY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:43.02,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,You're not looking at what's inside a person. \NYou're looking at their position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:47.10,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,You want to be someone \Nwho's dating someone in the top group,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:50.52,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,and you want to brag about\N being with that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.11,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,SudaKen makes my heart race!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:53.41,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,It's so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:54.14,Default - Top,Watanabe,0,0,0,,There you go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:56.41,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzuki! Should you \Nbe saying stuff like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:58.66,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Tani's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:02:59.82,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:01.41,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(189,265)\c&HE4CAF9&\3c&H9C66DE&}SLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:01.91,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(524,147)\c&HE4CAF9&\3c&H9C66DE&}SLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:02.41,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(196,162)\c&HE4CAF9&\3c&H9C66DE&}SLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.66,0:03:02.91,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,111)\c&HE4CAF9&\3c&H9C66DE&}SLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.71,0:03:04.79,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:05.40,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:06.29,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,She's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:09.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, did you hear that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:12.17,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I heard it, but I'm not going to get \Nworried over every little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.17,0:03:14.95,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Wow. Suzuki's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:16.94,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I think her entertainment \Nfactor wins out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:17.93,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:20.26,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh? What? What do they mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.18,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:23.43,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Those two are dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:23.43,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(96.667,128)\fad(522,1)\c&H6CFFFC&\3c&H4A0443&\4c&HFCED7A&\shad3\bord2\frz37.16}BLABBERMOUTH
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:24.63,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:27.70,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, why is everyone acting normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:29.31,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,They're accepting it so easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:32.57,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,but the first thing they thought had to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:36.23,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,"Suzuki, are you really fine with Tani?"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.57,0:03:39.15,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Because, I mean, Tani is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:48.33,Basic Sign,text; box,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnArial\b0\bord4\c&H830258&\move(468,312,573,312,1441,2650)}OUTLIER
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:48.33,Basic Sign,text; top,0,0,0,,{\c&H941FD8&\3c&HC8F9FC&\4c&H8452A1&\shad2\an8}SUZUKI WITH FRIENDS
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:41.37,Italics,Suzuki,0,0,0,,{\move(121,237,241,237,262,1555)}SudaKen makes\Nmy heart race!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.33,Default,text; left bubble,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\bord4\b0\c&H63484A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\move(98,108,205,108,24,1734)}There\Nyou\Ngo\Nagain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.33,Default,text; right bubble,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\bord4\b0\c&H63484A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\move(162,106,270,106,24,1734)}SudaKen\Nmakes\Nmy\Nheart\Nrace!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:44.83,Default,text; left; bottom bubble,0,0,0,,{\pos(35.334,161.333)\fnArial\fs12\bord4\b0\c&H63484A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:44.83,Default,text; left; top bubble,0,0,0,,{\pos(34,122)\fnArial\fs12\bord4\b0\c&H63484A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0}Does\Nhe\Neven\Nexist?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:44.83,Default,text; right bubbles,0,0,0,,{\pos(178,118)\fnArial\fs12\bord4\b0\c&H63484A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0}I want someone\Nwho takes the lead,\Nsomeone who's\Njust a little forceful...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.71,0:03:44.96,Italics,Suzuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(101,234)}I want someone who\Ntakes the lead...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:47.25,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Suzuki's ideal and her reality \Nare just too far apart, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:48.33,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(71,142)\fnArial\fs16\bord4\b0\c&H63484A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0}A music video\Nwith a ton of \Nstrong men in it\Nis the best, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:51.02,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Sup! Morning, Tani!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:52.09,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:56.22,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,And how are you able to act \Nlike you've always been friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:58.42,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Is that from the movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:00.47,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Mine's over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:02.54,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Stop wafting hints this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:03.10,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\move(519,210,529,113)\fad(356,1)\c&H8B00D4&\3c&HE8C8FC&}HA\NHA
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.10,Basic Sign,text; left; bubble,0,0,0,,{\pos(81,32)\c&H6D5936&\3c&HFFFBB5&\4c&H6D5936&\shad2}WAFT?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:03.10,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Waft?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:05.85,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right! Suzuki, what about pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:07.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,W-We didn't take any!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:08.69,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Definitely a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:09.66,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,A photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:11.24,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:12.66,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What? I wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:13.67,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Show me! Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.67,0:04:16.99,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, stop! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:16.99,Italics,Taira,0,0,0,,Wow. For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:34.21,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,115)\fnArial}YOU AND I ARE POLAR OPPOSITES
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:52.71,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Ugh, it's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:54.43,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Vending machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:05:59.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey! Sup, Taira!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:01.01,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Sup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:05.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry, if you're after a Reality \NGold Strong, I just got the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:07.01,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I don't drink junk like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:09.26,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? But it's so good, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:14.52,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:17.84,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Why Tani?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:18.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:23.65,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(314,1)\c&HF5AB26&\bord0\blur1\move(127.667,150.333,66,40,1,1148)}SHUDDER
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:21.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,"You should pick me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:23.65,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,No, nothing like that. And don't shudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:25.91,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It's just, Suzuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:30.16,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(306,143)\c&H61FFF6&\3c&H8397E3&\bord2}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.91,0:06:28.98,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Unlike happy-go-lucky types \Nlike Yamada or Watanabe,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:30.90,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,you're always reading the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:32.97,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You worry about what other people think, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:35.17,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(146,308)\fs28\fad(357,1)\c&HCAD522&\4c&HCAD522&\shad1}BULLSEYE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.97,0:06:35.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's what you think of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:39.67,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Dating someone who's that \Ndifferent from you... It's unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.11,0:06:47.83,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,To be honest, I've always worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:49.82,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Balancing with everyone around me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:51.93,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,wondering what people think of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:57.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But maybe it's because \NI'm like this that the opposite...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:07:02.57,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That someone like Tani-kun, who never \Nwavers in who he is, looks cool to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:08.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:10.24,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:15.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It'd take another two hours to really \Ntell you about my love. Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:18.95,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Spare me. The excess sugar \Nwould make me vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:24.88,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Sitting by the window...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.55,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,is so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.58,0:07:28.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:31.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:33.27,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Did I surprise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:34.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:36.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:39.79,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,That's that thing couples do all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:40.27,Basic Sign,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs24\c&HFDF4F8&\3c&HC2AE84&\4c&HB7F0FF&\bord2\shad2\move(490,165,520,165,0,2231)}TOUCH
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:43.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I bought drinks. Which do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:44.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,A Strong mini?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:46.58,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Why are they both Reality Golds?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:47.44,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:48.66,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:49.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,How much was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:51.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You don't need to pay me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.27,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.27,0:07:55.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Seriously, you're so conscientious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.55,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,It pains me, but I can't help overhearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,In that case... three yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:01.07,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's not a grocery bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.07,0:08:02.92,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Don't they just get along so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:06.62,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzuki, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:07.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.71,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,The sports drink I froze won't melt,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:12.61,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,so I'm going around \Nhitting it on harder stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:15.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Please don't do stuff \Nlike a god of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:17.22,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Suzuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.22,0:08:18.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.31,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Show me your homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:23.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Again? You've been asking \Ntoo much lately. Do it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:26.19,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Tani?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:29.07,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H7D2FEE&\3c&H85EEFB&\pos(307,40)}STARE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:27.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.09,0:08:29.30,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,So, you're not gonna ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:31.75,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I mean, I've done it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:35.95,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,They're already using him for their own ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:39.92,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It won't help you. Are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:44.46,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It would totally save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:47.36,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You nitwit! Take a hint!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:52.50,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Suzuki is really looking at Tani.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:56.37,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,And everyone around her sees it \Nas her choice, so they don't reject it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.32,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Give it! Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.42,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No! Do it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.67,0:09:00.97,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,None of them are worried \Nabout other people's judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:02.18,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Honestly! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:06.48,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Oh. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:11.01,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I think I kinda get it in spite of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.11,0:09:18.13,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,The fact that someone who \Nwasn't really in my field of vision
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:21.18,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,suddenly got accepted and \Nacknowledged makes me feel conflicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:25.84,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,And thinking that the guy must've \Ncompromised makes things feel ludicrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:28.30,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,The reason I'm so concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:31.69,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,with other people's words, actions, \Nsocial standing, and rank...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:36.64,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,is because I have no personal basis \Nto rate those things with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.67,0:09:42.13,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Taira, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:44.77,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HB9C14C&\move(87,234,56,187,19,1563)\fad(770,1)}SILENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:49.70,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,People who have a firm sense of self \Ndon't waver because of changes in others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.70,0:09:51.82,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,They have their own independent identity!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:55.89,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's bound by a hierarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:58.29,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that? You're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:01.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! TairAzuma, good work today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:03.36,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Don't stick our vowels together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:05.36,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Are you walking home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:06.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:09.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:11.69,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:15.93,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Just look at how brazen \Nthey are, side by side like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:19.00,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Walking home together \Nwithout a care for who sees them...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:22.43,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You know, somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:24.69,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,those two can make you dream, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:27.24,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Well, you did debut a new you in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:28.83,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:29.94,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(265,170)\c&H762FC7&\3c&H5CCAF7&\4c&H5F1EC8&\shad1}SAME MIDDLE SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:37.09,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Say, Suzuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.78,0:10:38.20,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HA1FFFC&\3c&H7F0C63&\4c&HE4CAFC&\shad2\move(603,217,534,148,1,314)}HM?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:42.06,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,If, for example, there was a certain \Nideal type of person you liked,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:44.87,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I do think it would be good for me \Nto get closer to that ideal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:49.22,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,but I don't think I can deviate \Nfrom my own sense of ethics and morals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:49.91,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:56.09,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HB965F0&\bord2\pos(493.333,238.667)\frz17.28}ME THIS MORNING
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:56.09,Default,text; left bubble,0,0,0,,{\pos(189,169)\fs24\fnArial\b1\i1\shad3\bord2\c&HDCA0F8&\3c&HE13B62&\4c&HE13B62&\frz26.37\blur1}SUDAKEN
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:53.48,Flashback - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,When someone has a little bit of \Nbad in their aura, it's kinda cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:56.62,Flashback - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,and I totally understand \Nbeing attracted to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:10:59.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I knew it! You are bothered by it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:00.47,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm not bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:04.24,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, if it really didn't bother you, \Nyou wouldn't bring it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.80,0:11:06.46,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm... not bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:07.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:10.73,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.72,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Why do you seem happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:14.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:18.08,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.35,0:11:20.49,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:24.95,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,There are a lot of different types \Nthat I like. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:26.25,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:28.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And the "that's so cool" feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:32.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,could be because of their looks, \Ntheir inner self, or their actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:34.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,There are a lot of different genres \Nof adoration, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.81,0:11:36.76,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yes. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:39.05,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That face you're making is so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:39.01,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\bord4\c&H9D1EE4&\an8\blur1}SO ADORABLE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:41.51,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\c&H3222A7&\pos(581,352)\fad(231,1)\blur1\fs28}THAT'S\NBRUTAL
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:41.51,Flashback - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's devastatingly adorable, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:41.51,Basic Sign,text; left,0,0,0,,{\pos(66,310)\c&H3222A7&\fad(273,1)\blur1\fs28}BUT IT'S\NADORABLE
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.28,0:11:43.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,After all, people...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.19,0:11:48.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,just can't help being attracted \Nto their ideal sense of coolness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:52.02,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fs26\c&HAAFFD4&\3c&H8E610A&\bord2\fad(1021,1)\pos(478,301)}ANXIETY...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:55.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, you're so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:57.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,So adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.04,0:12:01.75,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.01,0:12:07.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tiny Tani-kun is so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:13.30,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:15.30,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HF3E6AD&\3c&H88771E&\fad(184,1)}SMOOSH...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.81,0:12:26.06,Default,Tani's mom,0,0,0,,Oh. You're up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:27.62,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Tempura woke me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.93,0:12:32.70,Default,Tani's grandma,0,0,0,,My, my. Tempura is as adorable as ever today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.19,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\move(320,-150,320,50,1,607)\c&HFFFFAE&\3c&HB3890C&}ADORABLE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:37.82,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs26\c&HA544E0&\3c&HDBFFFF&\bord4\pos(180,41)\fad(230,1)}ADORABLE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:37.82,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H98FFF8&\3c&H7B41A1&\fs28\pos(179,203)\fad(350,1)}UNDERSTAND
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.73,0:12:37.82,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs26\c&HCBC562&\3c&HDBFFFF&\bord4\fad(230,1)\pos(480,41)}ADORABLE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:37.82,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H98FFF8&\3c&HA27C1F&\fs28\fad(294,1)\pos(475,203)}DON'T UNDERSTAND
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:42.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(189,169)\fs24\fnArial\b1\i1\shad3\bord2\c&HDCA0F8&\3c&HE13B62&\4c&HE13B62&\frz26.37\blur1}SUDAKEN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:40.78,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,When someone has a little bit of \Nbad in their aura, it's kinda cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:42.95,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,and I totally understand \Nbeing attracted to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:45.65,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,There are a lot of different types that I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:49.56,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I said that it didn't bother me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:52.96,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,but Suzuki-san's idea of coolness...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.95,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,is it strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:01.96,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,If it is, then I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:11.39,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HE9EDAE&\3c&H8E8827&\4c&HFFFFFF&\shad2\bord2\pos(482,62)\fade(725,1)}WOBBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:10.24,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,So weighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:13.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.10,0:13:17.26,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Mom, where are my gym clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:22.47,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:24.64,Default,Suzuki's brother,0,0,0,,I'm not coming home tonight, \Nso I don't need dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.64,0:13:26.99,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Stop saying everything at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:30.22,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Let me ride part of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:31.16,Default,Suzuki's brother,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.59,0:13:38.76,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, hey! This far is okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:40.58,Default,Suzuki's brother,0,0,0,,Don't give me orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:46.76,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.77,0:13:53.79,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,The way Suzuki gets to school is kinda gnarly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:52.77,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HF59024&\3c&HFBE6BB&\bord1\pos(52,31)}STARTLE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:54.91,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:56.42,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Why are you asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:13:57.72,Italics - Top,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Why's she standing so close?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:58.40,Basic Sign,text; bottom of bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HA237F0&\pos(342,358)\fad(354,1)}DEJA VU
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:58.40,Basic Sign,text; top of bubble,0,0,0,,{\c&HA7FFFE&\3c&HA5AF11&\fs24\pos(337,168)\fad(354,1)}HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:06.42,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Tani, do you know who\N that was on the motorcycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:07.26,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:10.60,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Suzuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:12.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Azuma—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:11.04,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\c&H09D5F8&\3c&H0D4170&\pos(190,26)}MESSY
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:11.41,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\c&H09D5F8&\3c&H0D4170&\pos(417,28)}MESSY
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:11.79,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\c&H09D5F8&\3c&H0D4170&\pos(190,26)}MESSY
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:12.16,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\c&H09D5F8&\3c&H0D4170&\pos(417,28)}MESSY
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:12.41,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\c&H09D5F8&\3c&H0D4170&\pos(190,26)}MESSY
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:13.79,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:17.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this? Why are you together?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:18.92,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:21.66,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Hey, that was your older brother \Njust now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.66,0:14:22.76,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:23.43,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:26.01,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Getting dropped off on \Na motorcycle is so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:27.55,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Introduce me to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:30.49,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Azuma, I've told you, your taste is just awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:31.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right, Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.69,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Please leave me out of the discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:38.51,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:40.19,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HA9FFFB&\3c&H1272E9&\fs28\pos(262,40)\fade(353,1)}GRIN
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:43.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, Tani-kun, \Ndo you have siblings?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:43.95,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.37,0:14:47.20,Default,Suzuki; Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.85,0:14:50.60,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I wonder what they mean by "I can see that."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:53.75,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Suzuki, does your brother have a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:57.94,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No idea, but even if he doesn't, \NI definitely cannot recommend him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:57.21,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,What on earth am I seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.21,0:14:59.09,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\pos(211,272)\c&H970277&\fad(1,276)}TANI STUCK IN THE MIDDLE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:01.96,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnComic Sans MS\c&H4C4E58&\3c&HF7F8F6&\frz349\pos(498,167)\fad(438,1)}AFTER SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:04.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right! Now we shall go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:05.50,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:05.93,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:08.50,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm the library assistant today, \Nso I'll be staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:10.22,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, we have to accept \Nwhat's beyond our control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:12.47,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HE3E677&\fs24\bord1\move(202,124,197,97)\fad(1,184)}GLOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:15.72,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem like she accepts it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:19.52,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs24\pos(436,34)\frz6\c&H7F727A&\3c&HFEFEFE&}LIBRARY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:29.28,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H849F0E&\bord1\fad(1,394)\move(388,160,396,153)\frz294}SNEAK
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:30.53,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H849F0E&\bord1\fad(1,394)\frz294\move(302,161,306,155)}SNEAK
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.32,0:15:34.04,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:35.34,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:36.29,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HD2CC68&\bord1\move(324,221,324,211)\frz300}STARTLE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:37.79,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:41.11,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.11,0:15:45.79,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,When I thought about it, I realized \Nthat I've never really used the library,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:50.05,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd take this opportunity \Nto come and take a look, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:53.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry! I'm being kinda stalker-y, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:55.15,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I would never think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.15,0:15:57.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really? That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:16:01.21,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Actually, if I had to choose, \NI'd say I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:04.57,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Oh! Should I have told her that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.02,0:16:08.58,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,But I don't want to make her \Nwait here for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:09.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:12.45,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,If you get bored, you can leave first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:12.20,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&HFAE187&\3c&HAB3F6C&\i1\pos(490,148)\frz333\fade(1,939)}FWISH...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.95,0:16:19.93,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I mean, we are talking about me here, \Nbut I can read, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:21.62,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No, that isn't what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:22.96,Basic Sign,text; left,0,0,0,,{\pos(64,280)\fs22\c&H6F3B05&\bord1\fad(146,1)}CAUGHT\NTHE\NHINT
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:22.25,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\c&H7CFFFF&\3c&H643E13&\pos(555,84)}GASP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:22.96,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\c&H7CFFFF&\3c&H643E13&\pos(598.667,37.667)}GASP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:24.71,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Actually, forget what I just said!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:27.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just borrow a book \Nand head home for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:34.44,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,He's right. It's annoying having someone \Njust hanging around for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:40.23,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs28\an8\bord5\c&H770D9E&\3c&HD4FFFC&\4c&H39ABF2&\shad2\fad(483,1)}SUZUKI IN READ-THE-ROOM MODE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:34.72,Basic Sign,text; left bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord2\c&H533AC8&\3c&HB5F3FB&\frz34.25\pos(124,193)}FRIEND\NENERGY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:36.18,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Like when friends come to your part-time job
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:35.47,Basic Sign,text; right bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord2\c&H533AC8&\3c&HB5F3FB&\frz-34\pos(470,189)}WORK\NSMILE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:36.22,Basic Sign,text; left bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord2\c&H533AC8&\3c&HB5F3FB&\frz34.25\pos(124,193)}FRIEND\NENERGY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:40.23,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,and you don't know which version \Nof yourself to show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:36.73,Basic Sign,text; right bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord2\c&H533AC8&\3c&HB5F3FB&\frz-34\pos(470,189)}WORK\NSMILE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:37.48,Basic Sign,text; left bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord2\c&H533AC8&\3c&HB5F3FB&\frz34.25\pos(124,193)}FRIEND\NENERGY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:38.23,Basic Sign,text; right bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord2\c&H533AC8&\3c&HB5F3FB&\frz-34\pos(470,189)}WORK\NSMILE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.23,0:16:38.98,Basic Sign,text; left bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord2\c&H533AC8&\3c&HB5F3FB&\frz34.25\pos(124,193)}FRIEND\NENERGY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:39.73,Basic Sign,text; right bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord2\c&H533AC8&\3c&HB5F3FB&\frz-34\pos(470,189)}WORK\NSMILE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.73,0:16:40.23,Basic Sign,text; left bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord2\c&H533AC8&\3c&HB5F3FB&\frz34.25\pos(124,193)}FRIEND\NENERGY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:45.23,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:49.78,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,she didn't take that the way I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.93,0:16:53.74,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:58.87,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,This place closes at five o' clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:00.46,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Can you wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:07.59,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\3c&H723EAE&\c&HC7FFFC&\bord2\shad2\4c&H723EAE&\fad(273,1)\pos(326,58)}SHINE
