Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:19.18,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs18\bord1\c&H664E29&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz355\move(294,170,325,153)\fad(1,2895)}CONVERSATIONAL ABILITY = METHOD OF CONVEYANCE
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.26,0:17:21.23,Basic Sign,text; left; left bubble,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs18\bord2\c&H5F5053&\fad(2986,1)\frz24.06\pos(101.333,58)}COMMUNICATION\NCOMPETENCE
