Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:22.23,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(454,78)\bord1\c&H3B78EE&\3c&H9FFFFE&}GASP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.48,0:17:22.98,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord1\c&HA140ED&\3c&H9FFFFE&\pos(469,100)}FWIP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:27.56,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Up until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:31.24,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,the meaning of words beyond the literal...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:31.24,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\bord4\c&H9D1EE4&\an8\blur1}SO ADORABLE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.24,0:17:35.12,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,the difference between what's seen \Non the surface and what lies beneath...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:35.12,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\c&H3222A7&\pos(581,352)\fad(231,1)\fs28\blur1}THAT'S\NBRUTAL
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:35.12,Basic Sign,text; left,0,0,0,,{\pos(66,310)\c&H3222A7&\fad(273,1)\fs28\blur1}BUT IT'S\NADORABLE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:40.12,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,or, conversely, wondering if my intent \Nwas properly conveyed through my words...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.19,0:17:43.13,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I never gave any of it a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:46.13,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&HFAE187&\3c&HAB3F6C&\i1\pos(490,148)\frz333\fade(1,939)\blur1}FWISH...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:47.77,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Conveying thoughts through words
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:50.70,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,and comprehending \Nthoughts through words alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:52.32,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,it's hard to do that perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.17,0:17:57.67,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Right now, I can't help worrying \Nover every slight gap in understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:04.65,Basic Sign,text; left; circle,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord4\shad2\pos(126,129)\frz3\c&H756C18&\4c&H756C18&\3c&HACFEF1&}RETURNING THE KEY
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:02.89,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(559,119)\c&HA7FFFE&\3c&H7840E6&}EXCITED
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:03.39,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&HA7FFFE&\3c&H7840E6&\pos(555,275)}EXCITED
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:03.85,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(559,119)\c&HA7FFFE&\3c&H7840E6&}EXCITED
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:04.40,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&HA7FFFE&\3c&H7840E6&\pos(555,275)}EXCITED
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:06.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, Gomapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:09.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Gomapon, are you headed home now, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.43,0:18:10.98,Default - Top,Gomapon,0,0,0,,Can't you tell by looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:13.15,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(492,1)\bord2\fs24\c&H78FFFE&\3c&H436319&\shad1\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(232,258)}GOMAPON     {\shad0\c&H4C5C07&\3c&HFFFFFF&}( GO{\b0}tou {\b1}MA{\b0}saru {\b1})
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:13.15,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(492,1)\bord2\fs32\c&H4C5C07&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(403,262)} —
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:13.15,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(492,1)\fnArial\fs18\c&H4C5C07&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(508,268)}SOCIAL STUDIES\NTEACHER
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:13.79,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, your bike's electric! That's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.79,0:18:17.41,Default,Gomapon,0,0,0,,Don't laugh. And get home \Nbefore the sun goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:19.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:22.84,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:27.95,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Gomapon just left for home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:29.30,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,He was on a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:32.17,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't he ride a bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.80,0:18:36.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's just the bike he was riding was so tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:38.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The wheels were the size of anpan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:41.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I couldn't help thinking he looked so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:42.61,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,There it is again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:48.29,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, when you say "adorable," \Nwhat do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.29,0:18:50.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? What do I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.14,0:18:55.54,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,For example, I understand \Nhow a cat or a panda is adorable,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:59.21,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,but when it comes to Gotou-sensei, \NI don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.21,0:19:01.91,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, that's what you're asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.91,0:19:05.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,How can I put it other than "adorable"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:08.23,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's like my heart gets squeezed, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:09.46,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H8410EA&\3c&HDAFFFD&\fs26\pos(565,168)\fad(250,500)}SQUEEZE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.37,0:19:13.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Endearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.57,0:19:16.59,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Something like that, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:22.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But I guess guys don't really use \Nthe word "adorable" all that much, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.27,0:19:26.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:29.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I might keep going to the library!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:31.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The book I borrowed \Nis part of a series, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:33.78,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I read that a long time ago, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:34.49,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:37.24,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Then, if I read it, \Nwe'll be able to talk about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:41.90,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, tell me some books \Nyou recommend sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.90,0:19:43.37,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:46.83,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I mean, our tastes \Nare probably totally different!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:52.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But, it's like, not everything \Nhas to match perfectly, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:59.91,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Like, we can get to know more \Nabout each other, little by little...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:02.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,and when one of us says, "I like this,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:05.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,the other can say, "Yeah, \Nseems like something you'd like."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.52,0:20:08.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to become someone \Nwho knows things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:14.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:23.03,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I won't be able to become someone \Nthat fits your idea of coolness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.61,0:20:24.51,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:33.24,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You're adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.39,0:20:39.73,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Do you understand what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.31,0:20:42.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:47.01,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Then... I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.01,0:20:48.23,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:03.88,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh! It's Tani!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:06.24,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Tani! Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:07.45,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:11.64,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Hey, Tani?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:16.47,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,The other day, I asked Suzuki, "Why Tani?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:18.72,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? You asked her that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:22.47,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,She said that the way you know \Nwho you are is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:23.71,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.71,0:21:25.90,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What kind of terrible reaction is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:28.74,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's just, why would you go \Nout of your way to tell me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.74,0:21:29.60,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.84,0:21:33.86,Default - Top,Taira,0,0,0,,Because being complimented when you \Naren't around makes you the happiest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:33.86,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs36\c&H8851EC&\3c&HB5FEF8&\pos(337,344)}BAM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.61,0:21:37.80,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be better \Nto hear them in person?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.80,0:21:42.66,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,They might be saying it in\Njust to make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.66,0:21:45.81,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,They'll only say what they really \Nthink when you're not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.81,0:21:47.99,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You are way too suspicious of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:51.23,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, does that mean \Nyou want to make Tani happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:53.51,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You have a strange way of showing kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:54.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Taira-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:21:56.84,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,you're a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:00.87,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Like I said, there's no need for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.87,0:22:03.35,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I'm in the process of confronting \Nmy own negative emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.35,0:22:06.92,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,and I just happened to do something nice \Nfor you. I am not a good person!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:09.52,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Wow, you're a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:10.97,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,What kind of manga is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.97,0:22:12.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I told you, it's a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.29,0:22:14.28,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Suzuki, you reading a book is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.79,0:22:15.56,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.02,0:22:17.58,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,That's a weird combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:18.52,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.85,0:22:21.61,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Any longer, and I'd have had to listen \Nto her adoration for two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:21.81,Default - Top,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.81,0:22:22.58,Default - Top,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.11,0:22:23.53,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,There you go making Tani happy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.53,0:22:26.45,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Tani-kun is smiling, right? That's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:26.78,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&H89124C&\3c&HF7DAB7&\move(560,96,560,121)\fad(1,148)}TREMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:27.53,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&H89124C&\3c&HF7DAB7&\fad(1,148)\pos(69,130)}TREMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.21,0:22:28.84,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:28.28,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&H89124C&\3c&HF7DAB7&\pos(560,121)\fad(1,148)}TREMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.53,0:22:29.04,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&H89124C&\3c&HF7DAB7&\fad(1,148)\pos(69,130)}TREMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.04,0:22:31.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.04,0:22:37.04,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fs22\c&H89124C&\3c&HF7DAB7&\pos(179.667,120.667)\frz299.4}DANG IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.28,0:22:34.89,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I know that I'm way funnier than them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.89,0:22:36.41,Default - Top,Satou,0,0,0,,Why are you competing there?
